      {
        "id": "malfurion",
        "name": "Malfurion"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "One of Chromie's favorite Healers has to be Malfurion. His Innervate Trait provides her with precious Mana regeneration and cooldown reduction, while his Regrowth allows Chromie to stay in battle for a long period of time. Another Healer that works wonders with Chromie is Ana, whose Nano Boost greatly empowers Chromie's damage for a short period of time."
  },
